cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CYBERPULSE AI"
type: software
abstract: >
  CYBERPULSE AI is a cybercrime intelligence command center prototype for proactive
  ATM cash-out threat prediction. It combines an XGBoost-based risk model with
  anomaly and graph signals, explains predictions using SHAP, and supports an
  alert → investigation → PDF report workflow with a live hotspot map UI.
